  "summary": {
    "text": "Nemotron-H is an NVIDIA series of hybrid Mamba-Transformer language models that replace most self-attention layers with Mamba-2 layers to lower inference cost. The 8B, 47B and 56B base checkpoints were released in April 2025 as weights for research and development use, followed in June by 8B and 47B reasoning checkpoints with a 128K context.",
