  "notes": "Hybrid Mamba-Transformer series; parameter counts are recorded per variant. The research page also describes Nemotron-H-8B-Instruct, Nemotron-H-8B-VLM and Nemotron-H-56B-VLM, which were not found as public NVIDIA Hugging Face repositories on 2026-10-02 and are not recorded as variants; it says Nemotron-H-56B served as the backbone of Cosmos-Reason 1 (not in scope). The 4B checkpoints come from the Minitron-SSM compression work (arXiv 2504.11409) and their cards give a Hugging Face release of 10/23/2025. Categories stay language only: the reasoning mode belongs to two later variants, recorded as variant features. Repository creation dates from Hugging Face metadata: 8B base 2025-03-19, 4B base 2025-03-20, 47B and 56B base 2025-04-08, 4B instruct 2025-04-15, 47B reasoning 2025-05-22, 8B reasoning 2025-06-05."
}
